id: weights
name: Weights
kind: crafting
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Combat Rolls lower by the Apparel Bonus. Taken off after the 3rd Combat Round, a bigger Doff
  Bonus.
text: >
  Weights. Reduce your Combat Rolls by the Apparel Bonus. When you remove this piece of Apparel
  after the 3rd Combat Round of a Combat Encounter, increase the Doff Bonus by 1/2 (rounded up).

---

# "Reduce your Combat Rolls by the Apparel Bonus" - while this piece is the Top Layer. Each
# Combat Roll is reached unless a Quality narrows it to one: Focal's chosen Roll is
# `$reachesStrike` or `$reachesDodge` at 1 and the rest at 0. `$waived` is 1 while the
# reduction is ignored - Training Support, while its wearer Holds Back.
[passive]
if ($waived == 0) {
  strike -= $apparelBonus(bT) * $reachesStrike;
  dodge -= $apparelBonus(bT) * $reachesDodge;
  wound -= $apparelBonus(bT) * $reachesWound;
}

# "When you remove this piece of Apparel after the 3rd Combat Round of a Combat Encounter,
# increase the Doff Bonus by 1/2 (rounded up)" - kept by the Doff Bonus, when it is taken off.
